#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dced2200d942ada2885d23a7ca94e84e46b1beafb15cfe9e252e68388ef0caa
#. default-sha256: 097666862523dad9a3c12f817f94bbded9e40c68fcd4d4415a32550429ee4d53
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Padrone... ⟪k:7⟫Cosa ne pensa della storia fino a questo punto?"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Quale dei due fratelli pensa fosse nel giusto—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫il fratello, o la sorella?"

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b4e02f8b71f04a1b191965fbdecf1577a65635966f619ab448ea2eb6fdbe467
#. default-sha256: bec28b153b2424bb7870547cd301cb9879e1d2b27fa879db1c2b0b91828e9b60
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh. Mi scuso per la domanda inattesa. ⟪k:1⟫L’ho forse turbata?"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 210a40de84782b2e44e733b154dc6d35fbbfd3a72445dbd76018406c3eccc340
#. default-sha256: 131a4e9e4d61589f7499eec73cd6785372c8df7472f5c0429d03f6a4e6f94776
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cosa ne penso io? ⟪k:1⟫Mmh, sì, credo che Mell fosse nel giusto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Inoltre era "
"sicuramente più felice di lei."

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a5a8602d35f960e104d14d84c3ad1d5811b4c9d566a64c09de8208528f55a86
#. default-sha256: a736e28e25e067df5b9b656906b781296a5b5e702711c0d67aab19fe9ae89953
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come Mell aveva previsto, Nellie fuggì dal teatro, lasciando il suo fidanzato da solo."

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f8d0b8cc9ab7ed834a2de0ff427aa21baad3dfc5827078169f065e5c5fba0d2
#. default-sha256: 27a31f41dd89c262b8e115632eb9bbc3fc62ff4409ddf79c0f4e84c669129b67
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si fece strada fino ad una carrozza che sostava all’esterno—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probabilmente una "
"riservata ad un altro nobile—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e ordinò di essere riportata a casa."

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29203f1165954e342e79e965cba6994e6cbfc598bba51f2201231837436c6621
#. default-sha256: 88c36bbb80a906572f8b3596750c92b59b589af9d821a9fd6d59b202b836e5e4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’ipotesi di Mell era corretta: l’unico posto in cui poteva tornare⟪k:1⟫era la villa."

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1481cb0765f3a24804ccea6cc2f4b4af25fb6dc361ed6ede8f67ee234e85f476
#. default-sha256: 39672fe9f42d42f65ceef86109dfa3406c3620b8d8aa816486f6ea76d1e8a729
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il sole stava iniziando a tramontare, e da giovane donna quale lei era,⟪k:1⟫non poteva "
"vagare per la città tutta sola..."

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4071c6c866c37be3012b85525c5a49fefd7de664a88219ebbe88ec3b87fb783c
#. default-sha256: eeb808340d75a7aa9f187ad68dfea7ea81279e0d004916bcd8664db50d4b0a3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫né aveva conoscenti che potessero riaccompagnarla."

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93c8c13ef9bc4ddf882451a3f673923ed6e3a90bf83ae28f720e6f72a64204f3
#. default-sha256: 4ac7bf3e2261bc45112d6c2189adb2af15b740e117027a0c2cf03df92d4b2216
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il suo mondo era, in sostanza, composto da due soli elementi:⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫suo fratello e il "
"giardino di rose. ⟪k:3⟫Erano la luce della sua vita nella villa."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c28955e39698f02c52d8719336641d30377c31b688cda7bdcbedb94f2ebfaff4
#. default-sha256: e16f38f95f4f03d2b0323019a23feb6558b9afaca62a933b052a92e3869b6845
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lei aveva vissuto... ⟪k:2⟫un’esistenza molto solitaria."

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a01819cb0d27e201169095e6fe0fc3bacb585d66c785cc51d545e1f9f207522f
#. default-sha256: 0c64f11348ddefabb211a0062f06b4d84f158049122215b05542e607c562f8b2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01a5618cf862da5621700daec74c69c2c616eb2187bae92e236d8def1300ac27
#. default-sha256: 5bb87a0e5b2bb3d2d1d369b9b4ab29358584cfd34f982eba586ce2d5ed5c7252
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."

#: scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b6df5abe81f481a59e792544f797841c861964943aca43bac5c96ed78d84205
#. default-sha256: c2b04e8e2c63dd3571518dffeef11781934a1a88ec30e15ca1293aa90999c1e2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she escaped back home, Nellie went straight to her room, locked the door, and "
"began sobbing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quando tornò a casa, Nellie si diresse direttamente nella sua stanza, chiuse la porta e "
"cominciò a singhiozzare."

#: scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25870c3949f4a19ee6e1b1f95d9bb74728b62ff76cd391ccb69707c1b40e4f4f
#. default-sha256: c4c091686176a0bb8242894c5b966c247b6f56a9f0a9ed77ce5015e8635238e2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The waves of her sorrow came crashing effortlessly over the levees."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le onde della sua tristezza si abbatterono sugli argini senza troppe difficoltà."

#: scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91c652adab853f39d9208c7d8ac3c859f48d46befe8449747b4c2a04f1faa79b
#. default-sha256: a8e60eeb369a380d102e91cdeeef76338c525c52c8e52d2d1df2bb8c5c84899a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tears streamed through the cracked walls of the dams blocking her tear ducts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I muri che trattenevano le sue lacrime si incrinarono, e queste iniziarono a scorrere "
"attraverso le crepe."

#: scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b35af9fe7b5fdbaffb1ffcb2c91e11a98b62a145c2eff9ba48f142fb2a09c79c
#. default-sha256: 6c787b3fe7e4a2b814d94dd70d5d1515d9cc51ac709cd00d60bf3ba15d677dcb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why... ⟪k:7⟫whyyyy?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Perché... ⟪k:7⟫perchéééé?!"

#: scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: feef516a5bfe71a70ca9ba632889be507e12db025d06c394c6305de72610b701
#. default-sha256: 3107cd7faa18997a108ea038e917615d3b19be5f9d89ea62ab2b85689a5e2d96
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why won’t you help me, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why won’t you take my side...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché non mi hai aiutata, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché non sei stato dalla mia parte...?"

#: scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65074b191b3f418df0b0a155b90869f5b232b750086934bd67c20ac32974e6d6
#. default-sha256: 4b2aed73ae513d123bf24a3f84341822da83a8f75b63d5b9fa6f88e33f02b441
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The decor in her room appeared blurry through her damp eyes. ⟪k:1⟫Memories of the day she "
"had it redecorated played back in her mind with crystal clarity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’arredamento appariva sfocato attraverso i suoi occhi umidi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I ricordi del giorno "
"in cui ridecorarono la stanza si ripeterono nella sua mente con chiarezza cristallina."

#: scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 424ce77f31c20bda065a94f4c7a3b447f99165074c33c254cd4f1496ca3ae63d
#. default-sha256: 0742bb2871f640ab1c3b64399bffbf5c6e4d3fee8a1e7eb9ef6558d14fe24429
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She told me... ⟪k:2⟫she had no feelings for you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mi aveva detto... ⟪k:2⟫di non provare nulla per te!"

#: scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc8c5420a4285fc8d18d941d7a8a81c391d4a8d0ea1338a9c9480b6dd0adb6f8
#. default-sha256: 1a0c174caed48f6a198b603099b67e851b942d62ff9b90fe61dfb649fc248b98
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That liar!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That liar!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quella bugiarda!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Bugiarda!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fa52a23f76d713e04d70bfa91b2e2542518e404aea9ba8f7964a74f69878aea
#. default-sha256: 821122fb80a28616844e3237745ba21706064fa8c50c531d6a7b6ae68068e10d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She let her emotions run wild, breaking glass craftworks, silver plates designed by famous "
"foreign artisans, flower vases, all sorts of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lasciò che le sue emozioni si scatenassero, rompendo prodotti d’artigianato in vetro, piatti "
"d’argento realizzati da famosi artigiani stranieri, vasi di fiori, qualunque genere di cosa."

#: scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 180e03cc92edc2c1cff2c34755bbc3c10921edfa1b835b11474547dc0901860c
#. default-sha256: 2cc09d62f9ebc002839dd8c4e53642fcc50074cbaa10a9047c870badf9f69ede
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though a beast had been set loose in her bedchamber."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era come se una bestia fosse stata liberata nella sua camera da letto."

#: scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b99684b24f7f362f25a3ff5353d22c9fd6c2db95518458cc363513e3231342b9
#. default-sha256: d5dfbea8168a7504cc13d5e1eeaab0fb9589f2f804a901c0daf5d521c94522b4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3b4e1046c068812e36cbffb0011759e1e7ca2a56e0c24ed27ffe1d6d0561e7d
#. default-sha256: c42c277f5f74efcf095226da45dd30311499053b93f25b9f194cd4391b86da94
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The vase she tossed shattered against a painting hanging on the wall, spraying water, "
"porcelain, and roses in every direction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il vaso che aveva scagliato via si frantumò contro un quadro appeso⟪k:1⟫al muro, "
"disseminando acqua, porcellana e rose in ogni direzione."

#: scenario:scenario_84F082A5_A3E5_4E7E_8AC5_6484D5DC1230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07563b5fe53f90ca8fb8189305471ca92617c581dddbd84024d76f9fa10dd62a
#. default-sha256: cb3aee5c4eabc8fbc06106d6acb7e24e793a559a24afa369b1cb17300bca82b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_84F082A5_A3E5_4E7E_8AC5_6484D5DC1230"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the portrait she adored so dearly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of her and her brother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era il ritratto che adorava così tanto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫quello di lei e suo fratello."

#: scenario:scenario_3DABB154_376C_4289_A9E0_041E20822ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
